---
/**
 * HTML version of the app's comment reader: an agent's reply with a teammate's comment anchored
 * to highlighted words, the agent answering in the thread, and Send to agent.
 */
import './mock.css';
---

<div class="mk cm">
  <div class="cm-chat">
    <div class="cm-bar">
      <span class="mk-back">←</span>
      <span><b>Payments webhook retries</b><span class="mk-meta">The agent’s reply · 2h ago</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="cm-msgs">
      <p class="cm-user">Why is the payments webhook retrying so much?</p>
      <p class="cm-agent">
        I traced the retry storm to the webhook handler. When a delivery arrives twice in quick
        succession, the first request takes the ledger lock and the second one waits. The problem is
        ordering: <mark class="hl hl--amber">the ledger write happens before the idempotency check</mark>, so
        the second request writes a duplicate row and the sender retries every 500.
      </p>
      <p class="cm-agent">
        <mark class="hl hl--blue">I recommend returning 200 for a duplicate delivery</mark> and moving the
        idempotency check in front of the write.
      </p>
      <p class="cm-chips"><span class="chip chip--amber"><svg class="mk-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z" /></svg>Ben +1</span><span class="chip"><svg class="mk-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z" /></svg>You</span></p>
      <p class="cm-user">Go with 200 for duplicates. Also check the refund path.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cm-side">
    <p class="mk-meta">SAM agent replied · 30m ago</p>
    <div class="thread">
      <p class="who"><span class="mk-avatar">BO</span><b>Ben Okafor</b><span class="mk-meta">40m ago</span><span class="mk-badge mk-badge--amber">Open</span></p>
      <p class="quote">the ledger write happens before the idempotency check</p>
      <p>Is moving the check enough, or do we also need a unique index on the delivery id? Two writers could still race.</p>
      <div class="reply">
        <p class="who"><span class="mk-avatar">SA</span><b>SAM agent</b><span class="mk-meta">30m ago</span></p>
        <p>The unique index already exists; the check just has to run first so the duplicate never reaches it.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="actions">
        <span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Reply</span>
        <span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost send" data-ring>Send to agent</span>
        <span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Resolve</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .cm {
    display: grid;
  }

  @container (min-width: 560px) {
    .cm {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .cm-side {
      border-left: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
    }
  }

  .cm-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
  }

  .cm-bar > span:last-child {
    display: grid;
  }

  .cm-msgs {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px 18px;
  }

  .cm-user {
    justify-self: end;
    max-width: 80%;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--mk-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
  }

  .cm-agent {
    color: var(--mk-ink);
  }

  .hl {
    color: inherit;
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0 2px;
  }

  .hl--amber {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-amber) 30%, transparent);
  }

  .hl--blue {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-blue) 22%, transparent);
  }

  .cm-chips {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 2px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.82em;
    border: 1px solid var(--mk-line-strong);
  }

  .chip--amber {
    color: var(--mk-amber);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-amber) 55%, transparent);
  }

  .cm-side {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
  }

  @container (min-width: 560px) {
    .cm-side {
      border-top: 0;
    }
  }

  .thread {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-green) 55%, transparent);
    background: var(--mk-surface);
  }

  .who {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .who .mk-badge {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .quote {
    padding-left: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: var(--mk-muted);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--mk-blue);
  }

  .reply {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-left: 10px;
    padding-left: 10px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
    color: var(--mk-muted);
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .send {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-green) 60%, transparent);
  }
</style>
